      "en": "$txcin_rate3"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "The third marginal rate of the Universal Social Charge (USC) basic-rate schedule, currently 3% (it has taken several distinct values historically, with 8 recorded value-changes). It is applied in txcin_ie/SchedCalc as the band_rate parameter for the third income band ('Tax schedule: basic rates'), taxing income between the second and third thresholds (e.g. up to €70,044). The latest value of 3% matches Rate 3 for 2025 shown in Table 21 of the USC documentation, down from higher rates (4%-4.5%) in earlier years."
    },
